@startuml KTOB_12_sequence_export
title KTOB - Owner-scoped Essential R1 JSON Export
actor Reader
participant "Angular" as UI
participant "Spring API" as API
participant "Export module" as Export
participant "Library contract" as Library
participant "Advisor contract" as Advisor
database "Supabase PostgreSQL" as DB
Reader -> UI : Export my essentials
UI -> API : GET /me/export
API -> Export : verify JWT and choose current readerId
Export -> Library : fetch owned library, reading, journal, collections
Library -> DB : reader-scoped queries
DB --> Library : records
Library --> Export : 4 arrays
Export -> Advisor : fetch explicit reading preferences only
Advisor -> DB : reader-scoped preference query
DB --> Advisor : records
Advisor --> Export : preferences
Export -> Export : assemble v1 JSON (5 arrays)
Export --> UI : 200 application/json {data: Export}
UI --> Reader : save personal copy
note over Export,DB
Does not claim full archive: chat, memory, offers,
acquisition and deleted resources excluded in R1.
No other reader's data is exportable.
end note
@enduml
